{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has established a frontline base on a planet rich in rare energy resources for research and extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a mysterious alien force suddenly emerged from deep within the planet, severing communications and causing the outer facilities to fall one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of a combat robot from an expedition unit, launching from the base\u2019s only safe zone\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the Control Room\u2014and venturing into the mutated sectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through one occupied room after another, confronting invaders, gathering resources, and assisting scientists in rebooting critical systems, while gradually uncovering the hidden secrets of this planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through repeated deployments and extractions, you\u2019ll advance the story, unlock new equipment and skill modules, and grow stronger to face even greater challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat That Rewards Timing: Fast Reload Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6a675d8d72073fcae91cba2c77b31ff6.poster.avif?t=1761117977\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6a675d8d72073fcae91cba2c77b31ff6.webm?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6a675d8d72073fcae91cba2c77b31ff6.mp4?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/f013039f96efc80dbe42f135d4e80527.poster.avif?t=1761117977\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/f013039f96efc80dbe42f135d4e80527.webm?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/f013039f96efc80dbe42f135d4e80527.mp4?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reload presents a chance to trigger a \u201cPerfect Reload\u201d, empowering your next attack or skill. Mastering timing and rhythm is key to dominating the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Equipment and Skill Loadouts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6bff978eca0613b299a6aa83fe82b134.poster.avif?t=1761117977\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6bff978eca0613b299a6aa83fe82b134.webm?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6bff978eca0613b299a6aa83fe82b134.mp4?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/c9e9eeffe1cdec926e6ea30a480dd6ae.poster.avif?t=1761117977\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/c9e9eeffe1cdec926e6ea30a480dd6ae.webm?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/c9e9eeffe1cdec926e6ea30a480dd6ae.mp4?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/4619ede7a9d83d88ef405ff090dc2eec.poster.avif?t=1761117977\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/4619ede7a9d83d88ef405ff090dc2eec.webm?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/4619ede7a9d83d88ef405ff090dc2eec.mp4?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each mission, freely configure your loadout: primary weapon, secondary weapon, ammo type, active skill, and support items\u2014crafting a unique combat style and strategic approach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression with Continuous Room Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is composed of randomly generated combat rooms. Clear them to choose your next route and advance step by step toward the boss battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Exploration and Progressive Unlocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each run, you can acquire enhancement items and rare loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you successfully extract, these resources can be brought back to base to unlock new skill modules, weapons, and character upgrades, deepening both story and gameplay progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Risk, High-Reward Extraction Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dying during a mission causes you to lose most of your rewards\u2014but special rooms and systems allow <strong>early extraction</strong> or <strong>partial resource delivery</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice between <strong>pressing deeper or retreating safely</strong> will shape your growth and long-term strategy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2893070?t=1761117977","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/6ffd3d51ff1a04ef19f7d4a34eed7681b70a1b18/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761117977","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/1e6065b19ca6a8535c699018f5a564ac13d5f927/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761117977","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/1e6065b19ca6a8535c699018f5a564ac13d5f927/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761117977","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has established a frontline base on a planet rich in rare energy resources for research and extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a mysterious alien force suddenly emerged from deep within the planet, severing communications and causing the outer facilities to fall one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of a combat robot from an expedition unit, launching from the base\u2019s only safe zone\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the Control Room\u2014and venturing into the mutated sectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through one occupied room after another, confronting invaders, gathering resources, and assisting scientists in rebooting critical systems, while gradually uncovering the hidden secrets of this planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through repeated deployments and extractions, you\u2019ll advance the story, unlock new equipment and skill modules, and grow stronger to face even greater challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat That Rewards Timing: Fast Reload Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6a675d8d72073fcae91cba2c77b31ff6.poster.avif?t=1761117977\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6a675d8d72073fcae91cba2c77b31ff6.webm?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6a675d8d72073fcae91cba2c77b31ff6.mp4?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/f013039f96efc80dbe42f135d4e80527.poster.avif?t=1761117977\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/f013039f96efc80dbe42f135d4e80527.webm?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/f013039f96efc80dbe42f135d4e80527.mp4?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reload presents a chance to trigger a \u201cPerfect Reload\u201d, empowering your next attack or skill. Mastering timing and rhythm is key to dominating the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Equipment and Skill Loadouts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6bff978eca0613b299a6aa83fe82b134.poster.avif?t=1761117977\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6bff978eca0613b299a6aa83fe82b134.webm?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6bff978eca0613b299a6aa83fe82b134.mp4?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/c9e9eeffe1cdec926e6ea30a480dd6ae.poster.avif?t=1761117977\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/c9e9eeffe1cdec926e6ea30a480dd6ae.webm?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/c9e9eeffe1cdec926e6ea30a480dd6ae.mp4?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/4619ede7a9d83d88ef405ff090dc2eec.poster.avif?t=1761117977\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/4619ede7a9d83d88ef405ff090dc2eec.webm?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/4619ede7a9d83d88ef405ff090dc2eec.mp4?t=1761117977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each mission, freely configure your loadout: primary weapon, secondary weapon, ammo type, active skill, and support items\u2014crafting a unique combat style and strategic approach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression with Continuous Room Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is composed of randomly generated combat rooms. Clear them to choose your next route and advance step by step toward the boss battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Exploration and Progressive Unlocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each run, you can acquire enhancement items and rare loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you successfully extract, these resources can be brought back to base to unlock new skill modules, weapons, and character upgrades, deepening both story and gameplay progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Risk, High-Reward Extraction Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dying during a mission causes you to lose most of your rewards\u2014but special rooms and systems allow <strong>early extraction</strong> or <strong>partial resource delivery</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice between <strong>pressing deeper or retreating safely</strong> will shape your growth and long-term strategy.</p>","developers":["Celestial Fuel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/241c548f30c393d8bcaab412bb6983e0659a6793/header.jpg?t=1761117977","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2893070/1924856946/e42ae83d9d4fa10b35d13e7ecf8009b3df804f3e/1760450188/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760451309","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2893070/1924856946/e42ae83d9d4fa10b35d13e7ecf8009b3df804f3e/1760450188/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760451309","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2893070/1924856946/e42ae83d9d4fa10b35d13e7ecf8009b3df804f3e/1760450188/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760451309","id":257217735,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217735/movie480.mp4?t=17604