l attacks and dive into random room challenges with high-risk extractions for a thrilling, skill-based combat experience.","steam_appid":2893070,"support_info":{"email":"celestialfuel.games@gmail.com","url":"https://discord.gg/sn4XbWhbdT"},"supported_languages":"English, Traditional Chinese, Japanese","type":"game","website":null}